0..79 Comment "// Addition on the naturals in the spellings an arm admits, each as the sugared"
80..157 Comment "// form writes it: a `run` that only sequences the recursive call, its result"
158..232 Comment "// returned or the `return` elided, is written with the call nested in the"
233..308 Comment "// constructor it returns (the base\'s `plus`), and a `run` written inside a"
309..389 Comment "// constructor\'s field stays. Each spelling runs to the same value. A structural"
390..463 Comment "// recursive call stands one stage below the term it was read from (Abel,"
464..538 Comment "// _Termination checking with types_, doi:10.1051/ita:2004015). The lists\'"
539..608 Comment "// folds are `recursive-lists.gandr` and `recursive-nat-lists.gandr`."
610..681 Comment "// The naturals, their addition with the recursive call nested, and the"
682..708 Comment "// numerals two and three."
